00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
This episode was released in the early days of Casefile. Since then, we have been made aware that incorrect terminology was used in the script. Out of respect for the LGBTQIA community, we have decided to remove the episode, with a view to rewriting and re-releasing it in the future. There aren't comments yet for this episode. Click on any sentence in the transcript to leave a comment.
